# 统一换行符：仓库与工作区都使用 LF
# text=auto 让 Git 自动判断文本/二进制，eol=lf 保证检出时也写 LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# 显式声明常见二进制类型，避免被当成文本处理
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
